<BaseLayout title="Privacy" description="Privacy information for the SWEEP Schools website preview. This draft requires review and approval before production use.">
<section class="page-hero"><div class="container"><span class="eyebrow">Website information</span><h1>Privacy notice</h1><p>This is a draft framework for review, not a final school-approved privacy policy.</p></div></section>
<section class="section"><div class="container prose"><h2>Preview status</h2><p>This preview website does not intentionally collect or store admissions enquiries, account credentials or learner records. Email and telephone links open the visitor’s own email or calling application.</p><h2>Before launch</h2><p>The school must confirm the responsible legal entity, information officer contact, purposes and lawful basis for processing, third-party service providers, cookies and analytics, retention periods, data-subject request process, security safeguards and arrangements for children’s information.</p><p>Any admissions form or parent portal must have its own documented data flow and appropriate safeguards before it is activated. This draft must be reviewed against applicable South African privacy law and approved by the school before publication.</p><h2>Contact</h2><p>For this preview, the public website lists <a href="mailto:schools@sweeplife.co.za">schools@sweeplife.co.za</a> as the school contact. The appropriate privacy contact must be confirmed by the school.</p></div></section>
</BaseLayout>